          "explanation": "aç + ı + ver — the request gets light: “just open it”."
        },
        {
          "id": "2",
          "prompt": "Kedi masaya atlayıverdi. What did the cat do?",
          "options": [
            "climbed up slowly",
            "suddenly jumped up",
            "wanted to jump"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "explanation": "-iverdi in the past — sudden and unexpected."
        },
        {
          "id": "3",
          "prompt": "“I'll sort it out in a sec” in Turkish:",
          "options": [
            "Hallederim.",
            "Hallediveririm.",
            "Halletmem."
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "explanation": "With the aorist, -iver promises: I'll do it easily and fast."
        },
        {
          "id": "4",
          "prompt": "Who should you not say “Kapıyı açıver” to?",
          "options": [
            "a friend",
            "your brother",
            "a boss you don't know"
          ],
          "answer": 2,
          "explanation": "-iver sounds familiar. With a boss — no turbo."
        }
      ]
    },
